The DOAC-VTE batch shows why this lane exists: several are real randomized DOAC-vs-VKA trials, but some report thrombus-volume or thrombotic-burden surrogates as the primary endpoint rather than the recurrent-VTE primary endpoint. I’m continuing topic by topic so each row gets its own four-fact decision, not a blanket verdict.
